      "description": "The World's Best Photo & Video Editing Apps | Lightricks Products LTX Models LTX Studio Popular Pays Facetune Photoleap Videoleap Our Model LTX-2.3 LTX-2 LTXV Documentation About Careers Blog Contact Us Lightricks' Products Discover new ways to express yourself. Let our innovative and powerful products transform your creation process. Facetune Facetune’s powerful editing tools help you create images and videos that make you feel like the best version of yourself. From everyday tweaks to an experimental transformation, Facetune makes it easy to put more of yourself and your vision into every photo and selfie video. The Facetune app offers incredible makeup and retouching tools, and with the magic of AI, allows users to generate their own unique AI Avatars, backgrounds, and clothing. Experiment with your self expression and highlight what makes you, you! Facetune’s powerful editing tools help you create images and videos that make you feel like the best version of yourself. From everyday tweaks to an experimental transformation, Facetune makes it easy to put more of yourself and your vision into every photo and selfie video. With the next generation of the award-winning Facetune app , you can now elevate any image or video with our pro features. Experiment with your self expression and highlight what makes you, you! Start free trial Videoleap Making a story should be as satisfying as watching it unfold. That’s why we created Videoleap, an all-in-one suite of editing tools that helps creators of all skill levels turn sparks into stories. Whether you want to make artistic Hollywood-level films or simply share memories and moments with friends, the Videoleap app is the app for you. Pros will take advantage of powerful high-end editing features while beginners will have fun cutting and combining clips simply, intuitively, and on-the-go. Videoleap includes a feed and templates, allowing users and creators to share and remake content in just a click, lowering the entry bar for content creation and allowing you to make content quickly and easily! Start free trial Photoleap Pursue your creative potential and watch your vision come to life with Photoleap’s tools. Whether you’re an aspiring or experienced artist, you'll be blown away by all the creative possibilities packed into this photo editing and design app from layers and blending modes, to special effects. The Photoleap app also includes Instant edits, Pro effects, and powerful AI features to help you improve your creative process. Craft, share, and constantly uncover new possibilities for creativity. Start free trial Popular Pays Popular Pays allows creators to connect with brands and collaborate with ease. By using our advanced platform, creators can now discover new brands to partner with and ways to earn money as a full-time creator. Brands can leverage our platform, community, and service to discover talent, collaborate, and track their ongoing partnerships. Marketing your brand – or yourself – has never been easier. Try Now! More Apps Filtertune Filtertune is a fun and powerful app for creating and sharing your own personalized filters, looks, and styles. Create, share, collect, and trade customizable preset filters to give your photos that “wow factor.” Filtertune helps you achieve the aesthetic you’ve always dreamed of! Beatleap There’s video editing, and then there’s Beatleap. Whether you’re mixing your next workout instruction video, boomeranging your vacation, or just dancing it out with friends, Beatleap turns moments you captured into a mash-up of memories. Seamlessly sync videos to the musical beat of your choosing in just a few taps. Motionleap Magically bring your photos to life from the palm of your hand! With Motionleap, the creative possibilities are endless. Animate any part of your photo and create a moving masterpiece with this one-of-a-kind photo editor. Artleap Packed with tons of adventurous effects and feature options that transform p